J.A.R.V.I.S. — DEVELOPMENT ROADMAP

1. Project Goal

Build a personal AI assistant for Android inspired by J.A.R.V.I.S. from Iron Man.

The assistant should support natural voice interaction, intelligent reasoning, memory, task execution and proactive assistance.

2. Phase 1 — Planning and Architecture

- Define project requirements.
- Design system architecture.
- Document AI Core.
- Design the Memory System.
- Design the Voice System.
- Design the Action System.
- Define security requirements.
- Design the user interface.

Status: In Progress.

3. Phase 2 — Development Environment

- Obtain a suitable development laptop.
- Install Android Studio.
- Configure Kotlin.
- Set up the Android project.
- Configure Git and GitHub integration.
- Create the initial application structure.

Status: Planned.

4. Phase 3 — Basic Android Application

- Create the main application screen.
- Implement the J.A.R.V.I.S. visual identity.
- Build the energy core interface.
- Add basic animations.
- Create application settings.
- Implement manual activation.

Status: Planned.

