13. Development Principles

The project should follow these principles:

- Build incrementally.
- Test every major component.
- Prioritize security and privacy.
- Keep the architecture modular.
- Avoid unnecessary complexity.
- Maintain clear documentation.
- Preserve user control over important actions.

14. Current Project Status

Current stage: Planning and Architecture.

The project is not yet implemented as an Android application.

The next major milestone is preparing the development environment and creating the initial Android project.
